# Kavaron, Memorial World: station (Lake-town Mariners, 6 power, tapped as the cost) puts six charge counters on it on
# turn 1 and six more on turn 3. At six counters the 12+ ability is not there (CR 721.2a): the refusal on turn 3 comes
# before the second station. At twelve, Bot1 pays {1}{R} (Mox Ruby, Mox Jet), taps Kavaron and sacrifices the Island it just
# played (a land other than Kavaron): a 2/2 Robot is created and then creatures Bot1 controls get +1/+0 and haste until end
# of turn, the Robot among them (3/2) and the already-tapped Mariners (7/x). The Robot attacks the turn it comes in
# (haste): Bot2 takes 3.

